:36:57.611Z\",\"type\":\"response_item\",\"payload\":{\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Investigating disk space issues**\\n\\nI'm noticing a discrepancy between `du` showing 29G and `df` indicating 96G full. It might be because of deleted open files, so I should check `df -i`. Maybe the overlay has images that `du` isn't counting. I think I need to free some space by removing temporary logs, using `rm` carefully since it's destructive. I should avoid deleting important working directories, but I could definitely clear out `/tmp/log-tmp` and bunx caches, or maybe some old clone node_modules. I'll also inspect the 17G in `/home`.\"}],\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABqJn8oVnlJ-BZdFMcsULw3m1wi86bK1cXia_GgnIuHDjckZILgBQdOTxK8I5JxoZfHXQOnwGA27ODLhVgqw7RPYbRffDP_UIx4iM4QLrFivJ09Xjmv0xVLu4Sv4AeU-7dge22Q80lQRT3C65coqqTJPQyZpyQ5qMLX2xUNHx0pUak7iWitu-U31D-4r7Z53JLkcTiJm5k1eeonpFXuis0uVIhZcHDilMvBBlpfiKop-r1w3UZpo0mTKt78qcxth9tpLt5l1uGnWGbO3Q9GMla3clSIsGIE1FBw0KLzl6Vh4Q4NKnO7bmvuxdcKVJPNI9TFukurPNkr4CQ9UMK1TigZwNoJLaNb4SDvKxKJHqlfh-yDQFqj0FrBzlyuJy62OQrIm_dpZvmVh7mcIFp4ho8AH5xlvSWNkPxboHrysWw6gCsONsCpNio8CpIMtTCJOO-L6IshOXCS4_CoWa0mmt4xYEcj9AnFR-JrVtSE8TTDjTftvh7U7oop2CajNkOS12Wtu6wPJP6t8VGdOzE8LZ8WNb0dMvvjigzAXv_jVbbBhJPpQvh6YziQrZO0bvwtUVDeaj47ED3_eDqB6GazwQW-Lkw-66VM8ZalggBAn1purxE8rswQMWKqO6mYu7jRUebk3BL6FIjcPVD-fHGZ0-g9toWLtCSlVpQO3xTpA8z815PNISdUQmULoWCbgeMFrmCrgOvDmaRFO2XEVtTxUFOidwFDq6pqNo9ownbH2D0zNRMolewKEkQH9f6N-osa40IZGslFtBwwUU7tgnxWnAKrJSHIC4iyamdxPHtezq4HCTREbAbhuudNtJyOSkGe2mWz_n0-b_-Ws6-cVmAWDRE-hQ91a6D2kUet2ZDEKUl1vtSP398Hh46GUIYEZ7SPmhCP469VPApLSHtu3DifjXKv83YhLumbeUou8fCjSNdGq0RXCirhV3ZBFBzLo3BSBXRhv2RuZ9in4TcJb5JPdJ5pZye1dhCGeiZcTi7FTzpP7pJUk8apBzVKgry7FeAM859WiB9Htnj9YI7O-21uv_Bo-GkJPttqYxeFVSTxRbXSW6pM-iG24GyC8yEqX9oLaKdvNLAyv5qB3Jci0PeDkBYsRsQchwpI-KrELle5n9HWjSgQsfSOJpzwrVYIZOfMnC5waodeg1DCz299CuvcoVip2fp8fVvfFCxdqjEbTI8O4vuQn1Cu068h2CpkWfGOMbbzyH1oHw219lhmUZWuSX7jzGEudwbPp6fSy7cR0jMgt-b13uMID_g_-Kl23fnlnioij3heU